PJ2 HTTP integration / DB interface demonstration
backend=mongodb, port=18080
$ cat /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/config-mongodb.yaml
# Local demonstration only; config.yaml remains on bbolt for grading.
nsf:
  sbi_address: "127.0.0.1"
  sbi_port: 18080
  db_type: "mongodb"
logger:
  level: "error"
$ /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/build/nsf-local -c /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/config-mongodb.yaml
$ GET /heartbeat
HTTP 204 null
$ GET /nnsf-disc {"service": "absent"}
HTTP 404 {"error": "failed to discover service: service \"absent\" not found"}
$ POST /nnsf-nfm {"nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "sbi_address": "127.0.0.2", "sbi_port": 8081, "services": ["pj2-a", "pj2-b"]}
HTTP 200 {"service_token_present": true, "service_uuid": "867b8a0a-f810-4f40-a6b6-b6acdd17428b"}
$ docker exec pj2-nsf-mongo mongosh --quiet --eval 'db.getSiblingDB("pj2_nsf_demo_33565").services.find().forEach(d => printjson(d))'
{
  _id: 'nsf:nf:PJ2-NF',
  value: '{"nf_name":"PJ2-NF","sbi_address":"127.0.0.2","sbi_port":8081,"services":["pj2-a","pj2-b"]}'
}
PASS: registration is stored in MongoDB and visible through mongosh
$ GET /nnsf-disc/group {"services": ["pj2-b", "pj2-a"]}
HTTP 200 {"services": [{"service": "pj2-b", "nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "sbi_address": "127.0.0.2", "sbi_port": 8081}, {"service": "pj2-a", "nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "sbi_address": "127.0.0.2", "sbi_port": 8081}]}
$ stop NSF and restart with the same database
$ /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/build/nsf-local -c /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/config-mongodb.yaml
$ GET /nnsf-disc {"service": "pj2-a"}
HTTP 200 {"service": "pj2-a", "nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "sbi_address": "127.0.0.2", "sbi_port": 8081}
$ DELETE /nnsf-nfm {"nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "services": ["pj2-a"]}
HTTP 204 null
$ GET /nnsf-disc {"service": "pj2-a"}
HTTP 404 {"error": "failed to discover service: service \"pj2-a\" not found"}
$ GET /nnsf-disc {"service": "pj2-b"}
HTTP 200 {"service": "pj2-b", "nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "sbi_address": "127.0.0.2", "sbi_port": 8081}
$ DELETE /nnsf-nfm {"nf_name": "PJ2-NF", "services": ["pj2-b"]}
HTTP 204 null
$ /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/build/nsf-local -c /home/ubuntu/pj2-nsf/config-mongodb.yaml
$ GET /nnsf-disc {"service": "pj2-b"}
HTTP 404 {"error": "failed to discover service: service \"pj2-b\" not found"}
PASS: heartbeat, registration, group discovery, restart recovery, partial deletion, durable deletion
